# The api/scheduler image is `COPY . .` of backend/ (build context). Keep anything that is
# not code out of it. Before 2026-10-21 the context was the whole /opt/pakdata, and every
# build baked the nightly DB dumps (~1.5 GB) and .env (secrets) into the image — a rebuild
# filled the disk mid-swap. Settings reach the containers via compose `env_file`.
.env
.env.*
*.dump
*.dump.gz
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
data/*
!data/reference/
tests/
